@page
@model IndexModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Attendance";
}

<div class="text-center">
    <h1 class="display-4">Welcome</h1>
    <p>This site can help you keep track of events that you have planned as well as people who come to them. </p>
    <p>To get started, create an event by clicking on Events. You can then add a list of people that you expect at that event. </p>
</div>
